        "content": "Each node and edge can use its own unit, decimals, color, and data links.\n\n1. Hover a node and an edge to compare their value formats.\n2. Select a mark to pin its tooltip. A footer appears only when that mark has a data link.\n3. Select a legend color swatch to change that node color.\n4. Select a legend label to hide that node and its connected edges."
